# A two-player battle quit from the pause screen, on the retail cartridge: tools/port/synth/battlequit.press with
# battle2p.press's mode screen of this cartridge (three down once the list is in: see battle2p.press here). The race
# end gives each player's pending packet back (object_activate), then the game over screen (docs/port/QA.md 5).
# until: 0x800000:200
# seconds: 120
# expect: state=0x00800000: players 2, windows 2, cars 2, mode 6, track 6
5 A            # the controller pak warning
8 START        # the start prompt
9 RIGHT 0.1    # the main menu's first option: two players
11 A           # the main menu: the race
14 A           # the player screen: both ready
14 A@2
17 DOWN 0.1    # the mode screen, its list in: three down
17.5 DOWN 0.1
18 DOWN 0.1
19.5 A         # battle mode
22.5 A         # the track select: the battle arena
25.5 A         # the car select: each player's car
25.5 A@2
36 START       # pause
37 UP 0.1      # its last item, quit
38 A           # are you sure?
39 RIGHT 0.1   # yes
40 A           # retired: the game over screen
